H2 + He+ -> He + H + H+     []                3.7e-14*exp(35e0*invT)

#KIDA
H2 + He+ -> He+ + H + H     []                3e-11*sqrt(T32)*exp(-5.2e4*invT)
He++ + e- -> He+            [2.73e0, 1e8]     3.36e-10/sqrTgas/(Tgas*1.e-3)**0.2/(1e0+(Tgas*1.e-6)**0.7)
