H- + H -> H2 + e-           [2.73e0, 1160]    1.43e-9
H- + H -> H2 + e-           [1160, 1e8]       exp(-20.06913897587003e0+0.2289800603272916e0*lnTe+0.03599837721023835e0*lnTe**2-0.004555120027032095e0*lnTe**3-0.0003105115447124016e0*lnTe**4+0.0001073294010367247e0*lnTe**5-8.36671960467864e-6*lnTe**6+2.238306228891639e-7*lnTe**7)
