H- + e- -> H + e- + e-      [2.73e0, 1e8]     exp(-18.01849334273e0+2.360852208681e0*lnTe-0.2827443061704e0*lnTe**2+0.01623316639567e0*lnTe**3-0.03365012031362999e0*lnTe**4+0.01178329782711e0*lnTe**5-0.001656194699504e0*lnTe**6+0.0001068275202678e0*lnTe**7-2.631285809207e-6*lnTe**8)
H- + H -> H + H + e-        [2.73e0, 1.16e3]  2.56e-9*Te**1.78186e0
H- + H -> H + H + e-        [1.16e3, 1e8]     exp(-20.37260896533324e0+1.139449335841631e0*lnTe-0.1421013521554148e0*lnTe**2+0.00846445538663e0*lnTe**3-0.0014327641212992e0*lnTe**4+0.0002012250284791e0*lnTe**5+0.0000866396324309e0*lnTe**6-0.00002585009680264e0*lnTe**7+2.4555011970392e-6*lnTe**8-8.06838246118e-8*lnTe**9)
H- + H+ -> H + H            [2.73e0, 1e8]     6.5e-9/sqrt(Te)
H- + H+ -> H2+ + e-         [2.73e0, 1e8]     1.e-8*Tgas**(-0.4e0)
